Any product claiming **N78-QA-001** release certification, or any edit to `{ProductPrefix}_QA_001_ENFORCEMENT_MATRIX.json`, governed exceptions, `verify-gate.ps1`, or QA suite Layer 1 / final disk gate wiring.

## Non-negotiable means

A **blocking** row in the product matrix whose verifier **executed PASS** in the release QA suite — not an agent having read this `.mdc` file.

